Despite stupidly thinking my cache had been eaten by a Xorn, when in fact 
the Xorn was just eating some random armour, my priest finally ascended.

I presume my pet Jabberwock was eating when I offered the amulet as it 
seems to have remained behind on the Astral plane. Most of the wishes I 
blew on Archon figurines: one was hostile, one peaceful, one eaten by a 
trapper, one by a purple worm, one survived, and 3 spare that I didn't use.

I had a bit of a chase to get hold of the amulet: Yeenoghu grabbed it from 
the priest and then hot footed it up the stairs. After I chased him up a 
few levels he summoned Demogorgon, but knowing cure sickness (and able to 
cast it reliably) meant I got in plenty of hits and made short work of him. 
I also finished off Yeenoghu at the same time because it was getting a 
little hot whenever Rodney turned up.

The sole genocide came from a throne, maybe next time I'll try a 
genocideless ascension.

Kusac, lawful male human Priest



